OL,3,GNEWSAWoman who got hooked on nasal
OL,4,Aspray for 10 years says it cost her
OL,5,Athousands
OL,6,
OL,7,FA woman says her blocked nose left her
OL,8,Fwith a decade-long addiction to
OL,9,Fdecongestant nasal sprays that cost her
OL,10,Fthousands.
OL,12,FLouise Gough, 30, failed to read the
OL,13,Ffine print on her over-the-counter
OL,14,FSudafed which warns it is for
OL,15,Fshort-term use only, and ended up
OL,16,Faddicted.
OL,18,FShe became so reliant on the medication
OL,19,Fshe was spraying up to 15 times a day
OL,20,Fand felt like a "prisoner in her own
OL,21,Fbody".
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
